{"results":[{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CFR80K_i9LQ/","final_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CFR80K_i9LQ/","title":"Mary and Jeff Bell Library on Instagram: \"#FactCheckFriday Fact?: Netflix CEO Kim Martin Morrow was arrested on child pornography charges. FALSE: In general, despite the controversy over the Netflix film Cuties, Netflix CEOs (Reed Hastings and Ted Sarandos) have not been arrested. Interestingly, in classic misinformation format, Kim Martin Morrow is not a Netflix CEO (let alone a high-ranking person working at Netflix). Despite this, this \"fact\" has rapidly spread through social media.\"","description":"5 likes, 0 comments - tamucclibrary on September 18, 2020: \"#FactCheckFriday Fact?: Netflix CEO Kim Martin Morrow was arrested on child pornography charges. FALSE: In general, despite the controversy over the Netflix film Cuties, Netflix CEOs (Reed Hastings and Ted Sarandos) have not been arrested. Interestingly, in classic misinformation format, Kim Martin Morrow is not a Netflix CEO (let alone a high-ranking person working at Netflix). Despite this, this \"fact\" has rapidly spread through social media.\". ","language":"en","text":"Never miss a post from tamucclibrary\n\nSign up for Instagram to stay in the loop.\n\nSign up\n\nLog in\n\ntamucclibrary\n\n•\n\nFollow\n\n---\n\ntamucclibrary\n\n Edited•319w\n\n#FactCheckFriday Fact?: Netflix CEO Kim Martin Morrow was arrested on child pornography charges. FALSE: In general, despite the controversy over the Netflix film Cuties, Netflix CEOs (Reed Hastings and Ted Sarandos) have not been arrested. Interestingly, in classic misinformation format, Kim Martin Morrow is not a Netflix CEO (let alone a high-ranking person working at Netflix). Despite this, this \"fact\" has rapidly spread through social media.\n\n## No comments yet.\n\nStart the conversation.\n\n5\n\nSeptember 18, 2020\n\nLog in to like or comment.\n\n---\n\nMore posts from tamucclibrary\n\nSee more posts\n\n---","author":null,"published_date":"2020-09-18T14:01:02.000Z","latency_ms":4137.645076989429,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}